# The reverse-usage graph answers "if I change this module, who is affected?".
# This repository has no modules yet, so `doqs generate` writes a single node with
# empty lists. Committing that is noise. Track it once `modules/` has entries, and
# gate it with `resolve_graph.py --check`.
/graph/usage-graph.json

